          {
            "start_line": 82,
            "end_line": 84,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// Violates rule 5: the last S is not removed when comparing to DEUTS, which is // phonetically similar. The result DAT is correct for DEUTSCH too. Original: DATS. assertEncoding(\"DEUTSCH\", \"DAT\");"
